OL,3,GNEWSAProbe into death of man killed by
OL,4,Aneighbour on bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man murdered in North
OL,7,FLanarkshire has welcomed a fatal
OL,8,Faccident inquiry (FAI) into his death.
OL,10,FNicholas Henry hit Daniel Greer, 33,
OL,11,Fwith a shovel and stabbed him nine
OL,12,Ftimes in Airdrie on 17 October 2020.
OL,14,FAt the time of the attack, Henry was
OL,15,Fout on bail for another violent
OL,16,Foffence.
OL,18,FThe attack took place in the victim's
OL,19,Ffront garden. Henry then dragged
OL,20,FGreer's body back inside the house. His
OL,21,Fbody was found by his father two days
OL,22,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
